WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:02.480
Handa-kun.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:06.080
Can you take these prints to Tsutsui Akane-kun?

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.560
You're not hiding your disgust...

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.900
Tsutsui...

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:16.080
There's a truant student in Handa Sei's class.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:22.930
There's a memo from me inside, so all you have
to do is hand him the package, Handa-kun.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:28.450
He was small and a bit feminine, so he must
have been a perfect target for bullying.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:29.790
His name's cute, too.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:32.350
He must have gone through a lot, too...

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.770
Huh? No one's home?

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:41.830
Lucky me!

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:43.430
I'll just put it through the mail slot and leave.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.140
Hey...

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.830
Whatcha doing at my place?

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.420
One wrong move and you're dead meat!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:53.430
Whoa...

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:56.130
He looks like some kind of wrestling villain.

00:00:56.630 --> 00:01:00.200
Um... I came to see Tsutsui
Akane-kun, who lives here.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.160
I'm Akane.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.470
Just tell me! Too many choices to make...

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.050
What is the answer? More than I can handle...

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.390
I don't know anymore! Got too much liberty...

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:28.930
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.810
Get my words, take my rights!

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:34.190
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:34.310
Get my words, take my rights!
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.650
Get my words, take my rights!

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:39.110
Everyone's lying to themselves!

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:41.610
After all this grieving... wailing...

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.900
has something managed to change?

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:46.780
We run away before the fight even starts,

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:49.790
as a sorrowful yesterday enters refrain.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:55.670
Get up now! These twised emotions have nowhere to go-

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.340
It's a problem everyone faces

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.800
unable to even sleep at night!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.010
C'mon and Break down!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.640
Abandon any half-assed resolutions!

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:10.430
Whether this future can be broken through, or not- you'll never know unless you try!

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:15.980
Searching for an answer, even questioning the times you live in,

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:20.360
No one is going to give you an answer!

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:26.160
So let loose that feeling engraved in your heart-

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.990
Choose your liberty... and take it in hand!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.890
H-Here...

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.520
This is the Tsutsui Akane-kun who
became a shut-in due to bullying.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.350
That's me.

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.310
Seriously?!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:50.600
Wh-Wh-What's with the change?!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.440
There isn't a shadow of
his former self remaining!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.440
Did he bulk up through surgery?!

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.070
Tch...

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.570
Stop flashing this shit around.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:03.620
I bet the teach asked you to come here
to convince me to go back to school.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:07.200
No... I just came to deliver this to you.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.710
I ain't returning...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.960
...no matter what anyone says!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.010
Not intimidated, are you?

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.720
And he didn't even flinch...

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.970
Not bad.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.220
That was too sudden for me to react...

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.890
Let me tell you a story.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:30.850
A year ago...

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.940
...I was a target of bullying.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.690
Who do you think you are, squirt?!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.780
Look at that girly face of yours!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.110
Stop acting like a sissy!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.570
Damn, he's so cute!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.370
Look at those long girly eyelashes!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.410
Don't follow us into the restroom!
You're distracting!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.450
Verbal abuse was a daily thing.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.160
You're getting in our way! Go away!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.370
The guys kept sending me away.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.830
Stop seducing my boyfriend!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.380
The girls labeled me a bitch.
Stop seducing my boyfriend!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.500
The girls labeled me a bitch.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.300
By the time the first term ended,
I stopped going to school.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:04.510
I shut myself in my room,
and kept blaming my small, weak self.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.140
Then one day...

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:07.680
...I finally found out!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.850
A muscular body can be yours using this!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.650
Get spectacular muscles by
wearing this just 30 minutes a day!

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.110
Hello? I'll take one!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.280
What I lacked was power!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.450
With power...

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.570
I... can...

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.830
I can...!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.580
Mom

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.040
Half a year later...

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.130
...I put down all the punks
hanging around the area.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.170
Only an image

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.430
No one in the area dared to go up against me.
Only an image

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.970
I showed them my power!
Only an image

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:46.140
I showed them my power!

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:50.770
Now that I'm the greatest, there's no
need for me to go to school anymore.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:51.890
Huh...

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.600
I've been bragged to by a relative stranger.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.900
I have no intention of mingling with others.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.610
I've been in police custody
a number of times already.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.240
In any case, I can leave as long he takes this.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:03.990
Take it!

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.450
I've been in countless fights, so I can tell...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:09.700
He's...

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:11.830
...sizing me up.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.670
Is he going to use physical
force if I don't comply?

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:16.830
If so...

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.670
I can't get close enough...

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.340
He's been in a lot of fights...

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:29.390
He's moving?!

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:34.730
What's that eerie yet self-composed
aura he's emitting?!

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.520
These calligraphy tools are so heavy...

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.560
My shoulder's aching...

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.060
It can't be...

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.190
Me, shaking...?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.110
I beat all those punks!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.570
Just take this alread—

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.660
I found ya!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.450
You hear me, Tsutsui Akane?!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.790
The punks from Kuro High?!

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.080
More weirdos!

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.790
We're here ta pay ya back for
the things you did to our guys!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.790
Get ready for a beatdown!

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:03.300
Damn it!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.260
That one guy was already
more than I could handle!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.670
What should I do?!

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.100
You're going to fight alongside me?!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.980
There, I'm done.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:16.850
Time to go.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.980
Go get 'em, guys!

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.400
Bring it on!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:26.030
I don't know his name, but it's not bad
having someone watch my back.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.110
Excuse me. I need to go.

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:32.450
Even if I lose, I'll always be grateful to you.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.620
Wait up!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.910
You're Tsutsui's buddy, right?!

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.120
Huh...?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:38.460
S-Sorry!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.380
Let go of my precious tools!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.630
What's with those eyes of his?

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:46.590
Hey... isn't that... Handa Sei?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.050
Handa? Who's that?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.550
You don't know him?!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.800
He's an outlaw that even
the teachers can't control!

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:56.520
Isn't he the one who orchestrated some guy's
downfall and then seized his position?

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:59.480
I heard he has 666 lovers!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:02.900
He stole a motorcycle and drove it through
the night when he was five years old.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.860
Handa... You mean the "Bear Killer"?!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.320
He killed a bear?!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.070
Tsutsui! How the hell are you
connected with Handa?!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:12.910
He just attends the same school as me!

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:13.950
Freakin' liar!

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.870
There's no way a guy like that
would mingle with others!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.540
Hey!

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.500
I'm out!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.460
I'll die if I get involved with Handa!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.210
I don't wanna die, either!

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.170
We'll let ya go this time!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.220
So, his name's Handa...

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:36.850
What happened in school while I was gone?

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:41.230
No... I can't go back to school.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:47.530
Come to school

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.280
Damn it, Handa...

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.490
Who are you, really?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:03.290
Handa-kun, I heard you went
to Tsutsui-kun's place.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.540
I gotta hand it to you!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.630
I was surprised hearing from teacher that...

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.840
...he's coming!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.180
Huh? Is that him?

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.810
He's different from the photo...

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.520
He didn't know, either?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.810
It's good to see him here...

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:24.900
Handa-san...

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:29.400
It'd be arrogant for the likes of me
to ask that you be my friend, right?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.990
Just think of me as a bodyguard
to protect you from danger.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.160
I'll watch over you...!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.490
What did I do?!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.530
What did I do to you?!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:43.330
When the time comes,
let's be the best of friends!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.500
Someone, help!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.000
Kondo, let's head to the
home economics classroom.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.090
Okay!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.300
My name is Kondo Yukio.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.720
I'm a normal high-school student.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.510
I'm average at studies and athletics.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.890
I have a few good friends I get along with.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.640
I'm living a normal, but good school life.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.600
I don't want to become popular or
have a personality that stands out.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.730
I mean, this is what it means to be normal...

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:08.560
What are we gonna be making?

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.980
<i>"Handa-kun and Cooking Class"
What are we gonna be making?</i>

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:11.650
This stuff is for the girls.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.110
We'll be making sweet and sour pork,
salad, and pudding.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.320
Did everyone separate into groups already?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:20.080
...or at least that's what I thought.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:23.450
Why am I assigned to a group
of personalities like them?

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.960
Vice Chairperson Aizawa Junichi.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:27.380
The man who ruled over classes at his pleasure.

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:29.670
Obsessed Chairperson

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.050
Nikaido Reo. A former model.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:32.170
The man who can get over a hundred girls
to come running with a single word.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.050
Playboy
The man who can get over a hundred girls
to come running with a single word.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:35.380
Playboy

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.010
The before-and-after shocker, Tsutsui Akane.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:38.050
Former Girly Boy
The before-and-after shocker, Tsutsui Akane.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.140
The man who made a huge comeback.
Former Girly Boy

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:40.720
Former Girly Boy

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.560
And one more...

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.190
The man on the opposite end of the spectrum
from a normal guy like me—Handa Sei.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:46.440
The school's "Mr. Popular," shrouded in mystery.

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.730
Mr. Popular

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:49.020
Some say he's gentle like a god,
whereas others say he's harsh like a demon.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:49.400
God...?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.690
Some say he's gentle like a god,
whereas others say he's harsh like a demon.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:51.860
Demon...?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.490
The pressure...

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.360
The pressure's too great for me...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:00.990
Okay, you wash the vegetables, Tsutsui-kun.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.370
Reo-kun, you prepare the dishes.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.870
Kondo-kun, you'll do the peeling.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:05.830
Hey, hey!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.710
Why are you the one in charge?

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.880
There's someone better for the job than you.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.750
Yeah, same thought here.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:12.960
C'mon, we don't need to fight...

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.550
You guys don't get it, do you?

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.340
Huh?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:22.350
We're going to make a delicious meal
for Handa-kun to savor!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.100
Sounds good!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.970
I'll give instructions from the textbook.

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:26.980
I'm not good at cooking, you know?

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.020
Me either.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.900
You can do it, right, Kondo-kun?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.400
Huh? Well, sort of.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.320
Whaddya mean, "sort of"?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.440
That's odd...

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:38.030
Despite the special treatment,
Handa-kun looks pretty lonely.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.910
But this is a class, so if Handa-kun doesn't
participate, then it defeats the purpose...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:41.240
I don't care.
But this is a class, so if Handa-kun doesn't
participate, then it defeats the purpose...

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:41.870
I don't care.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.490
I didn't say I wanted to participate.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:44.950
Huh?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.370
I'm saying that it's none of your business.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.540
In the first place, guys aren't supposed to cook.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.920
You guys do what you please.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.050
You prideless lot can have fun together.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.590
He's trying to act tough?!

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:58.670
You heard him!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:03.010
Handa-kun, you have your lofty pride
to maintain, so just take it easy there!

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:03.970
Huh?!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.430
Wasn't that him just trying to act tough?

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:09.140
I wonder if this is normal
among unique people like them.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.520
Huh, pretty good...

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.820
This is normal.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:16.690
Normal?

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:18.650
Put the cut pieces on this.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.570
Are you stupid? That's too small.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.410
There's a bowl on that shelf there.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:27.120
I keep hearing scary rumors about them,
but they're nothing like how I heard them to be.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.910
Except Handa-kun, that is...

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.460
Let the one with a superb sense
of beauty put together the salad.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.960
I'll beautifully arrange the lettuce
like a rose in bloom.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.210
Handa's is special!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.840
Whoa! Now that's creepy!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.300
Mayo and ketchup for the aurora sauce.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.760
This could be taken as
some form of harassment!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.810
Look! Handa-kun looks like he's going to snap!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.640
Let's get the rice cooking.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:52.560
Hm?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.360
Handa-kun's moving?

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.360
I wonder if he's going to
make the dessert pudding.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:01.860
Well, there's not much "making" involved,
since it only requires adding hot water.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.160
You add hot water to make pudding?

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.200
That can't be right.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.910
Huh? He's not making pudding?

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.870
What is Handa-kun planning to do?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.420
Pudding is supposed to be made with effort.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.420
I'll show them by making my
own style of delicious pudding.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:23.380
First, a hint of brandy, then I add an egg...

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:26.430
Based on the caramel's color,
it must be a blend of soy sauce and sugar.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.770
I heard that chocolate mellows the flavor.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:33.020
Salt to bring out the sweetness...

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.770
Thicken it with potato starch...

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.650
What is he trying to make us eat?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.240
I need to avoid eating it at all costs!

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.320
Say no to violence!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.110
Hey, wait! What happened?!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.450
He gave me the wrong amount of oil to use!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.910
Couldn't you have figured out it was
too much when you were adding it?!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.120
Now, now!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.620
All we need to do is to drain the oil.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.750
C'mon, you should already know how to cook
after shutting yourself in for a year.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.550
You're making matters worse,
so just be quiet and...

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.800
I'm gonna kill ya!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.050
Let's see you do it, moron!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.180
Come on...

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:07.680
That's right! Handa—

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:13.850
Flambé?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.350
No...

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.900
It was dangerous with the fire on,
so I used water to...

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.440
Everyone, run!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.820
I'm going to be fired if someone gets hurt!

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.320
Handa-san, watch out!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.530
Water! Water!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.320
Honey's supposed to be good for burns!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:30.410
I... I need to do something!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:32.750
Everyone, move!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.250
I said move!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.550
I can't see through all this white.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.470
What the hell is wrong with your eyes?!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.510
Stop laughing, guys.

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.760
Looks like Handa-kun did it again.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.520
He must have done all this to
stop us from fighting each other.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.810
That must be it.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.480
Huh?!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:57.770
It was my fault.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.520
Is that true...?

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.280
After all that we did to make it,
it's all ruined now.

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:06.900
Come to think of it, I recall seeing
Handa-kun put something in the refrigerator.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:08.950
That's...!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:09.870
Pudding?

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.950
Handa-san made this for us?

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.040
Time to eat!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.080
Wait! Those are...!

00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:22.090
Are you all okay?

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:26.010
I've never tasted pudding like this before...

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.840
The soy sauce accents it well!

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.350
Yup, yup! Japanese-style is
what Handa-style is about!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.220
You're all forcing yourselves, right?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.520
I can already tell the new muddy
and sandy texture is going to be a hit.

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:39.440
I'm don't do well with sweets,
but for some reason, I can eat this.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.060
What is making you guys say all that?!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:42.650
Huh?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.070
What are you saying?

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.320
Handa-san made it.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.570
Here, this one's yours.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.740
This is absurd!

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.620
But this is the power Handa-kun holds.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.910
An existence that can change white into black!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.870
H-Here I go...

00:14:59.040 --> 00:14:59.670
Tastes good, right?

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.120
An ordinary Joe like me can't grasp his appeal.
Tastes good, right?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.040
Say it tastes good!
An ordinary Joe like me can't grasp his appeal.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.420
An ordinary Joe like me can't grasp his appeal.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.250
Truly amazing, Handa Sei...!

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.720
I heard there was a fire in the kitchen earlier.

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.260
Rumor has it that Handa-kun
displayed amazing flambé prowess!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.180
Flambé?!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:12.800
Yeah!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.310
Like, he finished the pudding with a fire pillar!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:18.060
Handa-kun really can do anything!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.230
While such baseless rumors spread...

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:24.820
...Handa ruined the pudding he just bought.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:32.030
<i>"Handa-kun and His Friend"</i>

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:32.950
Everyone in school hates me.
<i>"Handa-kun and His Friend"</i>

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.620
Everyone in school hates me.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:38.330
Despite that, I still have one friend.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.170
Hey! Handa!

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.460
But while in school, I act like I don't know him.
Hey! Handa!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.750
But while in school, I act like I don't know him.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.880
Like any other day, I ignored Kawafuji again.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.340
But I hope he understands.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:54.140
I can't have him becoming a loner, too!

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.180
One loner is enough, and that's me.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:01.600
An eraser?

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.110
She...

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.360
...didn't notice?!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.610
What to do? Should I return it?

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:09.690
But...

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.690
You dropped this.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.820
You? Touching my eraser?!

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:15.490
Like, super dirty and stinky!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.790
...if she says that, I won't be able to recover!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.000
I know!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.960
Huh? My eraser?

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:24.960
Use it.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.550
What the...?

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:31.090
He traded erasers knowing that
my eraser was about to run out?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.800
Thank goodness I had a new eraser with me!

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:36.390
There's no way she can make a
stink with a brand-new eraser.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.180
Whoops, I messed up.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.650
She planted mechanical
pencil lead into the eraser?!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.440
Mechanical pencil lead
She planted mechanical
pencil lead into the eraser?!

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:47.610
What evil!
Mechanical pencil lead

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:47.940
What evil!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.360
What to do? I can't use this!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:54.320
Handa-kun's aura is all-out today, too.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.740
There aren't many who actually
look good standing by the windows.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.040
You're so lucky sitting next to him, Miyoko.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.580
Not at all!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:02.960
I can't glance to the side!

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.000
Fake an accident and hug him!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:06.460
No way!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.670
Dark Calligraphy
C'mon, you're sitting next to him.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.710
Nope!
Dark Calligraphy

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.630
Why don't you sit next to him instead?
Dark Calligraphy

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.550
Don't cry...
Dark Calligraphy

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:14.260
Dark Calligraphy

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:17.010
Assigned cleaners, make sure
you sweep the place up.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.180
Okay.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.100
Ah, you don't need to, Handa-kun.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:20.560
Huh?

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.020
You have to work on your
calligraphy today again, right?

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:24.440
But I'm assigned...

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.310
C'mon, don't worry!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:29.940
We can find a replacement for your assignment,
but no one can replace you, Handa-kun.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.320
Here, you do it!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.320
See you! Bye-bye!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.450
We're so caring, right?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.620
We're scoring high!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:38.740
They sure are sly...
We're scoring high!

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.530
What should we do if he tries to thank us?
They sure are sly...

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.120
What should we do if he tries to thank us?

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.660
I can't wait!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:48.920
That was quick.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.050
I'd appreciate it if they just
told me I was in their way?

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.170
I'm so lucky that I could ditch cleaning.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.590
Huh? Are you crying?

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.800
I'm not crying!

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.640
Ah, do you mind if we stop here to buy paper?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.470
Sure.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:03.520
It's for practice, so I need to buy a lot.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.560
Not so much that it becomes a load, right?

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.060
Hello there.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.560
Hey, it's Kawafuji.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:09.770
Hey, Akemi.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:10.770
Shopping alone?

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.110
Ain't that sad?

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:14.070
I'm not alone, there's...

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.660
Handa, why there?!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.200
We came to buy paint.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.450
Uh, I see.

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:23.910
Ah, it's over there.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:30.250
Sorry, Kawafuji...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.920
I don't know why, but I feel I can't
let anyone see you like that.

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:36.340
Later.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:37.720
See you, Kawafuji.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:38.510
Yeah.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:41.930
Did they leave?

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.680
So, why did you hide like that all of a sudden?

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:48.480
Isn't it a problem if they
find out you're my friend?

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.270
Handa, you...

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.320
I can't get out...

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.940
Excuse me, but can someone
bring something slimy?

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.200
Slimy!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:18:59.530
Sorry.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.320
I bothered you, and now I'm
having you carry my papers.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:05.160
You were planning to have me
carry your stuff, weren't you?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.500
That's not—

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.960
Enemy approaching!
Emergency maneuver!

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:14.340
Hey, it's Kawafuji-kun.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:16.590
Handa, you...

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:18.970
Later.

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:19.970
Bye-bye!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:20.880
See you!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.010
Did they leave?

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:26.220
Are you always hiding like that?

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:30.350
I don't hide when I'm alone, but with
you here, I don't want to cause problems.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:32.440
Handa...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.230
Ah, more incoming.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.940
Damn it! So many people!

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:40.570
What do you want to drink?

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.030
Black bean tea.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.580
Okay, then we'll have
black bean tea and black coffee.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:45.990
Understood.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.160
You're like an old man, Kawafuji.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.790
If I'm an old man, you're a geezer.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.170
Hey, if it isn't Kawafuji.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.170
Hey.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:56.960
Did you see Handa Sei around?

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.550
Uh... Not really.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.890
So, that's why a lot of our fellow
students are wandering around.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.810
Now there's a weird rumor spreading!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.230
Handa wouldn't do such a thing.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.770
You're right. See you!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.610
Sorry for the commotion.

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.990
Thank you for waiting.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:20.650
C'mon...

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:24.490
There's no problem in having
everyone know that we're friends.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.950
There's no need to hide.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.000
Kawafuji...

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:36.340
Despite being popular, Kawafuji treats
the likes of me the same as anyone else...

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.800
My one and only friend, Kawafuji...

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:43.090
I promised myself again in my heart today...

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.180
I'm going to act like I don't
know him until we graduate.

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.270
I'll do everything I can to protect you!

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:57.150
Actually, I'm the reason why
Handa is personality is like this now.

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.530
Are you Handa-sensei's son?

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.740
You know my father?

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.610
I first met Handa during the
entrance ceremony in middle school.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.910
We bonded over the subject of calligraphy.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.830
That calligrapher is like this,

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:09.870
and this letter is actually like that
to the calligrapher, and...

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.870
Sure, he had some quirks,

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.540
but he seemed friendly despite his looks.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.210
Then one day...

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.880
Can you give this to Handa-kun?

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.340
Kawafuji-kun, you're Handa-kun's friend, right?

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.760
Senpai was known for her beauty, and I was an admirer.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:22.800
Senpai...

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:26.430
Despite my popularity in class,
she used me as a go-between.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.890
In shock, I...

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:30.140
Hey, Handa!

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.310
What is it, Kawafuji?

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:37.600
Senpai is telling everyone that you're
a letter-writing, narcissistic brush face.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:40.360
Handa shut his heart.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.570
Handa was purer than pure.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:48.320
He was shocked to learn that he was being
slandered by a popular school beauty.

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.120
I tried to take back what I said,
It was just a joke, Handa. See?

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:50.990
but he didn't listen to me one, bit.
A love letter.

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:51.870
Girls. Are. Scary.
but he didn't listen to me one, bit.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.290
Girls. Are. Scary.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.160
What the heck?!

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:56.120
One... two... three... four... five...

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:58.330
One day, I'll correct all the misunderstandings

00:21:58.330 --> 00:21:58.420
so that Handa can live a calm, peaceful life.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:00.130
There's five of them!

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:00.920
so that Handa can live a calm, peaceful life.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:04.010
I want to tell him how popular he really is.

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:05.300
But...!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.180
Kawafuji, this place isn't safe!

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:08.220
I'm having fun, so I'll leave him alone for now.
We have to leave!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.510
I'm having fun, so I'll leave him alone for now.

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:21.770
Don't look for me- Don't look for me-

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:25.060
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:31.240
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:37.120
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.200 --> 00:22:42.370
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:46.630
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:50.340
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:54.300
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:58.560
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.800 --> 00:23:06.150
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:11.320
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:18.990
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:22.200
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:26.460
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:42.730
Hey, is it true that Tsutsui's back in school?

00:23:44.570 --> 00:23:48.610
When we teased him a bit last year,
he stopped coming to school, right?

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.280
Let's go and say hi to him!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:56.910
Maybe he'll cry just seeing us!

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:58.500
Man, I can't wait!

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:02.040
What?

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.510
Next time, "Handa-kun and Handa-kun?"
and two others.

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:09.630
See you again!
